  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Differentiating with respect to <math><mi>x</mi></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />Now, by property <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>g</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> {<math><mo>∵</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the inverse of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>}<br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
